OL,3,GNEWSANI's economic output rises, but
OL,4,Abusinesses warn of rising costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FEconomic activity in Northern Ireland
OL,7,Fin the second quarter of this year grew
OL,8,Ffaster than the UK and Republic of
OL,9,FIreland, according to official figures.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's economic output,
OL,12,Fwhich is broadly equivalent to UK GDP,
OL,13,Frose by 2.3% in the year to June.
OL,15,FComparing economic activity in both NI
OL,16,Fand UK, NI had stronger growth over the
OL,17,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
