OL,3,GNEWSANI's economic output rises, but
OL,4,Abusinesses warn of rising costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FIreland's GDP increased by 10.2% over
OL,7,Fthe latest quarter, but its "Modified
OL,8,FDomestic Demand" (MDD), which removes
OL,9,Fthe distorting effects of
OL,10,Fglobalisation, experienced a decline of
OL,11,F0.8% over the quarter.
